change your strategy or valuations.</p><label class="tw-check"><input id="trade-include-picks" type="checkbox" checked disabled>Include draft picks in this search</label><p class="muted">Turning picks off excludes exact current picks from generated packages only. It does not change your entered offer or saved preferences.</p></details>\n<section id="trade-target" class="tw-target" hidden aria-label="Selected trade target"></section>\n<div class="tw-primary-actions"><button id="trade-find" class="tw-primary-action" type="button" disabled>Generate Trades</button><button id="recommendation-refresh" type="button" disabled hidden aria-describedby="recommendation-status">Show Next 5</button></div>\n<p id="recommendation-status" class="ds-inline-feedback" role="status" aria-live="off" aria-atomic="true">Preparing current league assets…</p>\n<p id="trade-search-readiness" class="ds-inline-feedback">Search capacity will be checked when you generate or evaluate.</p>\n<button id="trade-cancel" type="button" hidden>Cancel current operation</button>\n<span id="trade-results-home"></span><section id="trade-result" role="status" aria-live="polite" tabindex="-1" hidden></section>\n<details id="recommendation-previous" hidden><summary>Earlier search · not revalidated</summary><p>Earlier offers have not been searched with the current filter. Your Evaluate draft is unchanged.</p><div id="recommendation-previous-offers"></div></details>\n<div id="trade-tray" class="tw-tray" hidden><span id="trade-tray-text"></span><button id="trade-tray-view" type="button">View Trade</button></div>\n<details id="trade-asset-options"><summary>Owned assets and exact constraints · optional</summary>\n<div class="tw-partner-controls"><label for="trade-partner">Counterparty</label><select id="trade-partner"><option value="">Choose a trade partner</option></select></div>\n<div id="trade-board"><div class="tw-side-tabs" role="group" aria-label="Asset side"><button type="button" data-side="sent" aria-pressed="